Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, libqt6core6 (>= 6.2) | libqt6core6t64, libqt6gui6 (>= 6.2) | libqt6gui6t64, libqt6widgets6 (>= 6.2) | libqt6widgets6t64, libqt6dbus6 (>= 6.2) | libqt6dbus6t64
Recommends: bluez
Description: Stage Wand Linux host with tray app
 LAN WebSocket and Bluetooth LE host that injects Stage Wand pointer
 and key events via uinput. Includes the Qt 6 tray app (stagewand)
 and the CLI host (stagewand-host).
